{"headword":"בְּנָה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Aramaic Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. build (</strong>BH <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּנָה</span><strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. sf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנָ֫הִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:11\" href=\"/Ezra.5.11\">Ezr 5:11</a>; i s. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּנַיְתַהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:27\" href=\"/Daniel.4.27\">Dn 4:27</a>; Impf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִבְנוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:7\" href=\"/Ezra.6.7\">Ezr 6:7</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְמִבְנֵא</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:2\" href=\"/Ezra.5.2\">5:2</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">לְמִבְנְיָה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:9\" href=\"/Daniel.5.9\">9</a> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">לְמִבְנֵא</span> M <sup>§ 64 u</sup> or < <span dir=\"rtl\">לְמִבְנֵה</span>, so S-C<sup> A 3. 64</sup>), <span dir=\"rtl\">לִבְּנֵא</span> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">לְמִבְנֵא</span> Str <sup>§ 23 l</sup> M<sup> l.c.</sup>) v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:3\" href=\"/Daniel.5.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:13\" href=\"/Daniel.5.13\">13</a>; Pt. act. pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּנַ֫יִן</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:12\" href=\"/Daniel.4.12\">4:12</a> +; pass. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:11\" href=\"/Daniel.5.11\">5:11</a> (v. on forms K <sup>§ 47, Beisp. pass.</sup>);—<em>build:</em> c. acc. of temple <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:2\" href=\"/Ezra.5.2\">Ezr 5:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:3\" href=\"/Ezra.5.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:9\" href=\"/Ezra.5.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:11\" href=\"/Ezra.5.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:13\" href=\"/Ezra.5.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:17\" href=\"/Ezra.5.17\">17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:7\" href=\"/Ezra.6.7\">6:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:8\" href=\"/Ezra.6.8\">8</a>, so <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:4\" href=\"/Daniel.5.4\">5:4</a> (acc. cogn.); pass. of temple v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:11\" href=\"/Daniel.5.11\">11</a>; c. acc. of city <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:12\" href=\"/Daniel.4.12\">4:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:27\" href=\"/Daniel.4.27\">Dn 4:27</a>; abs. <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:14\" href=\"/Ezra.6.14\">Ezr 6:14</a><sup>(×2)</sup>."}],"form":"Pe."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>be built:</em> Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִתְבְּנֵא</span> of temple <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:15\" href=\"/Ezra.5.15\">Ezr 5:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:3\" href=\"/Ezra.6.3\">6:3</a>; 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּתְבְּנֵא</span> of city <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:13\" href=\"/Ezra.4.13\">4:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:16\" href=\"/Ezra.4.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:21\" href=\"/Ezra.4.21\">21</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִתְבְּנֵא</span> of temple <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:8\" href=\"/Ezra.5.8\">5:8</a> (c. acc. mater.), v <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:16\" href=\"/Ezra.5.16\">16</a>."}],"form":"Hithpe."}]},"rid":"BDBA0136","strong_numbers":["1124"],"next_hw":"בִּנְיָן","prev_hw":"בֵּלְשַׁאצַּר","all_cited":true,"brackets":"all","alt_headwords":[{"word":"בְּנָא"}],"root":true,"quotes":[],"GK":[],"TWOT":["2633"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Aramaic Dictionary","language":"ara.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB Aramaic","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}